# Grid cells for MainActivity, filtered by the search field: positions map through `visible`
# to the indices of renkin_preview_icons / renkin_preview_labels. Drawables load per visible
# cell at mdpi: the pack's rasters sit in the unqualified (mdpi) bucket, so loading at screen
# density would upscale every bitmap and large packs would run out of memory. A drawable that
# fails to inflate (e.g. adaptive XML on API 21-25) leaves its cell empty instead of crashing.


